    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d81">

                <pb facs="0167" n="85" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg85"/>

                <head>Mr. Sanford to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 262.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Brussels,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 1, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> The Moniteur of yesterday contains a note
                    touching the expression of the sentiments of the King, of the Count de Flanders,
                    of the minister of foreign <pb facs="0168" n="86" xml:id="pg86"/> affairs, and
                    the cabinet, as well as the House of Representatives, with respect to the
                    murderous attacks upon the life of the President and the Secretary of State. I
                    enclose it herewith.</p>
                <p>I have this day called upon the minister of foreign affairs to express my
                    gratitude for the condolences of the King, and of the Count de Flanders, and to
                    ask him to convey to his Majesty, and to his royal highness, the expression of
                    it; I took occasion at the same time to offer my thanks to him and his
                    colleagues for the evidence they had given for their sympathy on this
                    occasion.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with great respect, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>H. S. SANFORD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                    <p>(For enclosures see Appendix, separate volume.)</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d81-a1.xml" xpointer="d81-a1"/>
            </div>
